{"type":"message","id":"aef5b1d1","parentId":"067dc69e","timestamp":"2026-03-18T13:54:41.631Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Clarifying group chat limitations**\n\nI need to provide an answer regarding the group chat. There's probably no need for tools, since I can't see other agents' internal thoughts. I can mention that I can see the messages sent here, but I can’t verify what another participant is thinking unless they directly respond. So, I want to ensure clarity about my limitations in this group chat context while being helpful!","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_095ea5a1bc24e39b0169baae9cea60819189b5f352dcd56b61\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABpuq6gO6hyiCDuynzO3HGu-7l04zX10kT5EIrox1rBV1inr9UWBpw01LyBKwL6P3_37VZybRiUyMamZfZ9lNEltDH69Ql5w1s1e1zJA6O3VH5NOG0rN0jtfwXq5Ou5qCeYHpOiECoqyuli5OZdFdTkl5r7qXU3X7WmlllIHzxKRk_OYQoaFq0rrt8PaBqqi-5pv8KHDDE-XwEV9gBmTzYRYmSqPof8RvGRBYekEXNkPEjguRPltRKrvXKOI9GBfo7lIx-coQUjtltjdr0bEGj377H-qwVhx_JYnZJlwrB3Q6Rx2EBs1UtwjL2psjiCPbAw1MLoXpWUZwNPR9Sg9of33HZ2xOwhaVdHZiseKqvLQNxHR2Fw5SfeGEsOK3JAVm3c0eqOP7rClCNpmL_hM7KRIl5Vi9S_cgFy7Ro5NzIcHJSFTZI2rmNbBY4b7WTW7byuTuitoDI6_mU_8RbPm86lmiiMOD1vLe8k9NSLabytsEEYHizb0duy-BC2yqQQauq5RbpXvi6ct2ACNF9KfhCSgAqJW4SbQywufhKHiKXwDaOzRuu9DZXrc71HQKkiSHDn35-3W9NL2cGm28KSfK0h9-KnlxveW0LveInYITyKdn53eFEGP2_4g6Q0aIaGqS-cemz7ioh2QUrURXhaB6UUBz8l9a8PPg6AA3DLZgIvdZoqgLe0GuD_QEL_y7Q7I41hUqGMJxQK5Xv3qL6wTvuLFwGB60GZ-tnxVqvIHBSeStSxUceLVeXhjklZTXTwws1rZJ3vsoupMx60xgphA-nX3WbGH_dc0g6FL4wGzMxaALYrCQptwCiQ9gI3Cs0toRC2kyCyQmo-XiDmAHDDuhUPKv58pKwUx3cLgk1zoLPCIvq4n5u6gnabbNa1_KML5bNMJBCwThZB1RYM_9FY1nKxZ06rYP5n5nsK_qU4lekQh1okB_XuOgDMm5SqqOuT8yPWspS-NDRsXpNZPGbDTlzsMxxMdDRzx-KpiaafSYjSO8Y9y5l_A9frbTN024uQDmM5SKy37PaYkJo69rG9zUiUCzNALyW0w6j2JUgzjHUo3f13roKxlJjMeL0on2-SN4aiWMA2\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Clarifying group chat limitations**\\n\\nI need to provide an answer regarding the group chat. There's probably no need for tools, since I can't see other agents' internal thoughts. I can mention that I can see the messages sent here, but I can’t verify what another participant is thinking unless they directly respond. So, I want to ensure clarity about my limitations in this group chat context while being helpful!\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 我这边能看到**这个群里发出来的消息**，包括你刚刚这条。\n\n至于**薇薇那边能不能看到**，我没法替她确认，要看她是否也在这个群、以及她那边是否正常接收消息。\n\n最直接的验证办法：\n1. 你在群里发一句测试消息\n2. 让薇薇回个“收到”\n3. 我这边也可以同步确认我是否看到了她的回复\n\n如果你要，我现在可以配合做个三方连通性测试。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_095ea5a1bc24e39b0169baaea057688191967a5e6a78ea4715\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":17477,"output":180,"cacheRead":1536,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":19193,"cost":{"input":0.0436925,"output":0.0027,"cacheRead":0.000384,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.046776500000000006}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773842075687}}
