WHcmuqYdDpQTiA==\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Acknowledging requests for additions**\\n\\nI need to respond to \\\"补充,\\\" which seems to imply he’s asking for further additions. It might help to include improved content based on what he's shared before. He mentioned posting a SOUL.md and requested saving it, so I should clarify what specifically he wants to supplement. It’s probably best to ask directly or to proactively suggest what could be added. I want to be concise and straightforward in my response!\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 可以，直接把要补充的内容发我。\n\n如果你想让我代补，我建议再加这 4 块，SOUL.md 会更完整：\n\n1. **质量验收标准**\n   - 图片尺寸、清晰度、可读性\n   - 标题是否像小红书，而不是 PPT\n   - 首图是否足够抓眼\n\n2. **失败处理机制**\n   - 技能生成失败时怎么重试\n   - 图片数量不够时怎么补齐\n   - HTML 生成失败时怎么降级交付\n\n3. **文件归档规则**\n   - 项目目录结构\n   - 文件命名规范\n   - 每次产出保留主题、日期、版本号\n\n4. **和我这个“总监”的协作规则**\n   - 薇薇先执行\n   - 遇到方向不清、结果跑偏、连续失败，再升级给我\n   - 不要一有小问题就打断流程\n\n你要是愿意，我下一条直接给你一版**增强版 SOUL.md**，把这些补进去。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_095ea5a1bc24e39b0169bab3862524819192ba54ab88f16705\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":20975,"output":316,"cacheRead":1536,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22827,"cost":{"input":0.052437500000000005,"output":0.00474,"cacheRead":0.000384,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.05756150000000001}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773843318561}}
